WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.617 --> 00:00:03.152
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you sure this is salt?

2
00:00:05.345 --> 00:00:07.230
I think it’s sugar.

3
00:00:09.457 --> 00:00:12.130
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I’m sure it’s salt.

4
00:00:15.282 --> 00:00:17.921
I put some in the rice salad.

5
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:23.300
<v><b>A:</b></v> Let’s taste the salad.

6
00:00:25.287 --> 00:00:26.418
Aargh!

7
00:00:26.418 --> 00:00:29.057
It was sugar. I told you.

8
00:00:33.203 --> 00:00:34.984
<v><b>B:</b></v>Sorry!